              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.8.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 8:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tena nitaikomesha furaha yake yote, na sikukuu zake, na siku zake za mwandamo wa mwezi, na sabato zake, na makusanyiko yake yote yaliyoamriwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 5:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nami nitaiharibu mizabibu yake na mitini yake, ambayo alisema, Hii ndiyo ujira wangu niliopewa na wapenzi wangu; nami nitaifanya kuwa msitu, na wanyama wa mashamba wataila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amu 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.23.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 23:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nami nitamwadhibu kwa sababu ya siku za Mabaali, aliowafukizia uvumba; hapo alipojipamba kwa pete masikioni mwake, na kwa vito asema BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
